          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a project that can share screenshots with Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择一个可以向 Grok Bot 共享截图的项目。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige un proyecto que pueda compartir capturas con Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grok Bot とスクリーンショットを共有できるプロジェクトを選んでください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escolha um projeto que possa compartilhar capturas com o Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähle ein Projekt, das Screenshots mit Grok Bot teilen kann."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisissez un projet qui peut partager des captures avec Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grok Bot과 스크린샷을 공유할 수 있는 프로젝트를 선택하세요."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Выберите проект, который может делиться снимками с Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請選擇一個可以向 Grok Bot 共享截圖的專案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the Webhook URL on one line and the Authorization header on the next. Copy both from the ScreenClip reports routine in Grok Bot.": {
      "comment": "ScreenClip interface text.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste the Webhook URL on one line and the Authorization header on the next. Copy both from the ScreenClip reports routine in Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请把 Webhook URL 放在一行，下一行放 Authorization 标头。两者都从 Grok Bot 的 ScreenClip reports 例程复制。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pega la URL del webhook en una línea y el encabezado Authorization en la siguiente. Copia ambos de la rutina ScreenClip reports en Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Webhook URL を 1 行目に、Authorization ヘッダーを次の行に貼り付けてください。どちらも Grok Bot の ScreenClip reports ルーチンからコピーします。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cole a URL do webhook em uma linha e o cabeçalho Authorization na seguinte. Copie os dois da rotina ScreenClip reports no Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Füge die Webhook-URL in eine Zeile ein und den Authorization-Header in die nächste. Kopiere beides aus der Routine ScreenClip reports in Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collez l’URL du webhook sur une ligne et l’en-tête Authorization sur la suivante. Copiez les deux depuis la routine ScreenClip reports dans Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Webhook URL은 한 줄에, Authorization 헤더는 다음 줄에 붙여 넣으세요. 둘 다 Grok Bot의 ScreenClip reports 루틴에서 복사합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Вставьте URL вебхука на одну строку, а заголовок Authorization — на следующую. Скопируйте оба из процедуры ScreenClip reports в Grok Bot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請把 Webhook URL 放在一行，下一行放 Authorization 標頭。兩者都從 Grok Bot 的 ScreenClip reports 例程複製。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add the webhook URL too. Copy it from the ScreenClip reports routine and paste it with the Authorization header.": {
      "comment": "ScreenClip interface text.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add the webhook URL too. Copy it from the ScreenClip reports routine and paste it with the Authorization header."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请也加上 webhook URL。从 ScreenClip reports 例程复制它，并和 Authorization 标头一起粘贴。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Añade también la URL del webhook. Cópiala de la rutina ScreenClip reports y pégala con el encabezado Authorization."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Webhook URL も追加してください。ScreenClip reports ルーチンからコピーし、Authorization ヘッダーと一緒に貼り付けてください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adicione a URL do webhook também. Copie-a da rotina ScreenClip reports e cole junto com o cabeçalho Authorization."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Füge auch die Webhook-URL hinzu. Kopiere sie aus der Routine ScreenClip reports und füge sie mit dem Authorization-Header ein."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoutez aussi l’URL du webhook. Copiez-la depuis la routine ScreenClip reports et collez-la avec l’en-tête Authorization."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Webhook URL도 추가하세요. ScreenClip reports 루틴에서 복사해 Authorization 헤더와 함께 붙여 넣으세요."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Добавьте и URL вебхука. Скопируйте его из процедуры ScreenClip reports и вставьте вместе с заголовком Authorization."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請也加上 webhook URL。從 ScreenClip reports 例程複製它，並和 Authorization 標頭一起貼上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the key from the ScreenClip reports routine.": {
      "comment": "ScreenClip interface text.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the key from the ScreenClip reports routine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入 ScreenClip reports 例程中的密钥。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Introduce la clave de la rutina ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScreenClip reports ルーチンのキーを入力してください。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Digite a chave da rotina ScreenClip reports."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib den Schlüssel aus der Routine ScreenClip reports ein."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
